        "explanation": "Doctor provided a bounded, executable plan with observation, no self-medication, red flags, and follow-up materials.",
        "quote": "接下来这样做："
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00210",
        "explanation": "Caregiver confirmed understanding of no empiric antibiotics, no stopping antithrombotics, red flags, and what to bring to follow-up.",
