      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode closed after the family had a concrete plan: observe while asymptomatic, do not self-start antibiotics or stop rivaroxaban/clopidogrel, bring urine culture/urinalysis, renal function and medication list to follow-up, and seek urgent care for specified infection, bleeding, or cardiopulmonary red flags.",
